engy/chamberlain_multimodal_multiagent_chatbot","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:44:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b76a92ba983b4e6b8000afd3cf08a445"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2376afbc7ffd27f1416ba5d784deb79d7e39069a07b6e16074817ceed4f8294b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product is described as offering a voice-control interface, with speech recognition for input and text-to-speech for responses."},{"claim_ids":["clm_408a31fba1750ac9148a39210ad1cb32be7ef2bad0459389b470077523ef7d89"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Eat mode reportedly updates a persistent fridge state after cooking, and the demo notes a unit-mismatch issue causing unusual milk quantity values."},{"claim_ids":["clm_76bd3ae73c57a7172f98fceb0412f4bb875b5dfb050c594881d2f01d24045286"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installation requires Python, external prerequisites Tesseract and Poppler added to the system PATH, a pip install of requirements.txt, microphone setup, and API keys for OpenAI and Serp API placed in api_key.py."},{"claim_ids":["clm_84f0767009d79f6f12ae18d7b4728888ef0554560f8646fc8263dd8fe7163b34"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Chat modes such as Eat, Dress, Bill, Finance, and Grocery are selected automatically by the system rather than by the user, who is not told which mode is active."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8f2bdad7308b3736445963b8b7bb83ce95ac687db8940a435942a90ded266fdd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"OCR support for bills and financial documents likely relies on the required Tesseract and Poppler system tools, given they are listed as prerequisites alongside OCR-related features."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ac6470d0f36776e94e0c88e2ee7dc441d350a106e4832e1ec06c9ee26c8744d6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The assistant is built on large language models including GPT-4, GPT4V, and RoBERTa, using LangChain and multimodal embeddings for context-aware responses."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d60e0e07cfe3b0696659122eebaff233dd14a9099dfb34d89d23d09cca7196e1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"No benchmark or quantitative evaluation of the assistant appears in the provided evidence; the demos are anecdotal screenshots rather than measured results."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d94ade977e7ef68eca56345fa1b271bd6101d59f2c58d3323c91da46f03b1128"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README's demos show text I/O screenshots, noting the real output is fully audio, and the author acknowledges more functionality remains unexplored."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f46f36c2d2040c1f8d17d7753f4e1f7c89f94dd70d53d8c6d14852f1d2bdfbbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented capabilities include processing bills and financial documents, scanning grocery receipts, managing fridge contents, and giving fashion advice from user selfies."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2376afbc7ffd27f1416ba5d784deb79d7e39069a07b6e16074817ceed4f8294b","clm_408a31fba1750ac9148a39210ad1cb32be7ef2bad0459389b470077523ef7d89","clm_76bd3ae73c57a7172f98fceb0412f4bb875b5dfb050c594881d2f01d24045286","clm_84f0767009d79f6f12ae18d7b4728888ef0554560f8646fc8263dd8fe7163b34","clm_8f2bdad7308b3736445963b8b7bb83ce95ac687db8940a435942a90ded266fdd","clm_ac6470d0f36776e94e0c88e2ee7dc441d350a106e4832e1ec06c9ee26c8744d6","clm_d60e0e07cfe3b0696659122eebaff233dd14a9099dfb34d89d23d09cca7196e1","clm_d94ade977e7ef68eca56345fa1b271bd6101d59f2c58d3323c91da46f03b1128","clm_f46f36c2d2040c1f8d17d7753f4e1f7c89f94dd70d53d8c6d14852f1d2bdfbbc"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:44:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_b76a92ba983b4e6b8000afd3cf08a445","id":"pg_6610935d25df56c89a70eae5989bafc3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/nickshengy-chamberlain-multimodal-multiagent-chatbot-readme-md-cfed007-eae5989bafc3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b4c7c5e9caf35f6f81321c796ac9baaa"],"title":"nickShengY/chamberlain_multimodal_multiagent_chatbot/Readme.md @ cfed007ec7b6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:44:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b76a92ba983b4e6b8000afd3cf08a445"}
